Sill for Android
Copyright 2026 Omar Marei

This is the Android client for Sill, written by Omar Marei (https://github.com/omarei-omoto)
and proposed to the Sill project as https://github.com/Saffsanity/sill/pull/89. This repository
carries that code, with its git history, so it can be built, released and installed on its own.

